  "content": "\n\n<div><div><p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Otaku_Anime_World/MP_OtakuAnimeWorld_header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2800\" height=\"900\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif; font-size: 18px;\">全新《咒術迴戰》任務！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif; font-size: 18px;\">《御宅動漫世界 – Jujutsu Kaisen Craft》邀請您體驗獨一無二的動漫 RPG 冒險。在這個世界中，力量並非輕易可得：必須覺醒、鍛鍊並掌握。<br>受《咒術迴戰》宇宙啟發，此整合包結合了魔法、激烈戰鬥、探索與迷宮，為您帶來充滿動作、成長與持續挑戰的冒險旅程。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Otaku_Anime_World/MP_OtakuAnimeWorld_description.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2800\" height=\"230\"></span></p><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif; font-size: 18px;\">《御宅動漫世界 – Jujutsu Kaisen Craft》是一款以冒險、RPG 和戰鬥為核心的整合包，專注於在 Minecraft 中提供深受動漫啟發的體驗。其核心圍繞《咒術迴戰工藝》模組，並透過其他模組進一步強化探索、迷宮、戰利品與史詩級戰鬥。</span></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif; font-size: 18px;\">在您的冒險旅程中，您將能夠：</span></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif; font-size: 18px;\">🔮 掌握魔法與咒力：</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif; font-size: 18px;\">學習使用特殊技巧、獨特能力與直接受《咒術迴戰》啟發的力量。成長系統設計讓您從脆弱的玩家蛻變為令人畏懼的咒術師，解鎖全新的戰鬥方式與遊玩風格。</span></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif; font-size: 18px;\">⚔️ 體驗激烈且具挑戰性的戰鬥：</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif; font-size: 18px;\">戰鬥比原版 Minecraft 更具動態性、策略性與要求。<br>直面詛咒、危險生物與擁有獨特機制的首領，充分的準備與對技能的熟練掌握將成為取勝關鍵。<br></span></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif; font-size: 18px;\">🏰 探索迷宮與建築結構：</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif; font-size: 18px;\">世界中充滿了藏有強大敵人與獨特獎勵的迷宮、建築與特殊區域。探索永遠值得：更強大的武器、特殊裝備與關鍵資源正等待著您。</span></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif; font-size: 18px;\">🌍 持續的冒險與探索：</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif; font-size: 18px;\">多樣的生態域、新的建築結構，以及為鼓勵探索而設計的世界，讓每次旅程都成為尋找挑戰與秘密的機會。並非一切皆可見；進步需要好奇心與冒險精神。</span></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif; font-size: 18px;\">🎮 RPG 與多人遊戲體驗：</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif; font-size: 18px;\">此整合包支援單人與多人模式，讓您能夠：</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif; font-size: 18px;\">- 與朋友合作遊玩</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif; font-size: 18px;\">- 建立動漫 RPG 伺服器</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif; font-size: 18px;\">- 體驗激烈的 PvE 戰鬥</span></div><br><div><div><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\"><strong>準備好與朋友一起遊玩了嗎？</strong></span></span></p></div><div><p><a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/voxelcore\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Otaku_Anime_World/MP_OtakuAnimeWorld_promo.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2800\" height=\"350\"></strong></a></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif; font-size: 18px;\">立即開立屬於您的 Minecraft 伺服器，與朋友們展開史詩級的旅程！享受強勁效能、穩定運行時間與無後顧之憂的使用體驗。別忘了使用優惠碼&nbsp;<a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/voxelcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">VOXELCORE </a>即可享有伺服器 <a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/voxelcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">25%折扣</a>優惠！</span></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p></div></div></div>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Otaku_Anime_World/MP_OtakuAnimeWorld_screenshot.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2800\" height=\"230\"></span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1448216/description_192b4dd7-8b2f-465c-8180-40ef3b37169d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1448216/description_cb16f576-4c78-4780-857c-6dc03160aac7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1448216/description_b877302a-55c2-4181-995f-f9636e396b57.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></span>\n\n[<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Otaku_Anime_World/MP_OtakuAnimeWorld_discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2800\" height=\"230\"></span>](https://discord.gg/4qZvzDYgGT)",
